{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "view-swap",
  "title": "View swap",
  "group": "Motion",
  "order": 7,
  "summary": {
    "en": "One view replaces another in the same place: a tab panel, the next step of a form, a different range on a chart. The old view goes at once and the new one fades in from a 4 px blur and a 4 px rise in 240 ms. Quick enough to never feel like a page load; soft enough that the eye sees the change.",
    "id": "Satu tampilan menggantikan tampilan lain di tempat yang sama: panel tab, langkah berikutnya dalam formulir, rentang lain pada grafik. Tampilan lama langsung hilang dan yang baru memudar masuk dari blur 4 px dan naik 4 px dalam 240 ms. Cukup cepat agar tidak pernah terasa seperti memuat halaman; cukup lembut agar mata melihat perubahannya."
  },
  "titleId": "View swap",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A step-by-step form, forward and back",
        "desc": "Continue and Back swap the step content; the steps header fills its bar on the in-out curve and the focus moves to the new heading. Nothing slides sideways, so going back feels the same as going forward.",
        "html": "<div data-flow style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <ol class=\"steps\" aria-label=\"Application\"><li class=\"step is-current\"><span class=\"step__head\"><span class=\"step__dot\">1</span><span class=\"step__bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"step__label\">Program</span></li><li class=\"step\"><span class=\"step__head\"><span class=\"step__dot\">2</span><span class=\"step__bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"step__label\">Documents</span></li><li class=\"step\"><span class=\"step__head\"><span class=\"step__dot\">3</span></span><span class=\"step__label\">Review</span></li></ol>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; min-height: 132px;\">\n    <div data-pane style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\"><h3 class=\"card__title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Choose a program</h3><p class=\"card__sub\">Undergraduate, Computer Science, starting in February.</p></div>\n    <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\"><h3 class=\"card__title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Upload your documents</h3><p class=\"card__sub\">Your diploma, last transcript and a photo of your ID card.</p></div>\n    <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\"><h3 class=\"card__title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Review and send</h3><p class=\"card__sub\">Check the program and the three documents, then send the application.</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"form__actions\" style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary\" data-back disabled onclick=\"const f = this.closest('[data-flow]'); const panes = f.querySelectorAll('[data-pane]'); let i = [...panes].findIndex((p) => !p.hidden); i = Math.max(0, Math.min(panes.length - 1, i + (-1))); panes.forEach((p, j) => { p.hidden = j !== i; }); f.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach((s, j) => { s.classList.toggle('is-done', j < i); s.classList.toggle('is-current', j === i); s.querySelector('.step__dot').innerHTML = j < i ? '<span class=&quot;ic&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;>check</span>' : String(j + 1); }); f.querySelector('[data-back]').disabled = i === 0; f.querySelector('[data-next]').textContent = i === panes.length - 1 ? 'Send application' : 'Continue'; panes[i].querySelector('h3').focus();\">Back</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-next onclick=\"const f = this.closest('[data-flow]'); const panes = f.querySelectorAll('[data-pane]'); let i = [...panes].findIndex((p) => !p.hidden); i = Math.max(0, Math.min(panes.length - 1, i + (1))); panes.forEach((p, j) => { p.hidden = j !== i; }); f.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach((s, j) => { s.classList.toggle('is-done', j < i); s.classList.toggle('is-current', j === i); s.querySelector('.step__dot').innerHTML = j < i ? '<span class=&quot;ic&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;>check</span>' : String(j + 1); }); f.querySelector('[data-back]').disabled = i === 0; f.querySelector('[data-next]').textContent = i === panes.length - 1 ? 'Send application' : 'Continue'; panes[i].querySelector('h3').focus();\">Continue</button></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<ol class=\"steps\" aria-label=\"Application\">…</ol>\n<section class=\"step-view\" aria-labelledby=\"step-title\" style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\">\n  <h3 id=\"step-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Upload your documents</h3>\n  …\n</section>\n<!-- Render the new step (or unhide it): the animation plays each time the element is shown.\n     Then move focus to its heading. -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "Tab panels",
        "desc": "The ink slides; the panel below swaps with the blur-in. `.tab-panel` has the swap built in.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Lab report\" data-lds-tabs>\n    <span class=\"tabs__ink\"></span>\n    <button class=\"tabs__btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"vs-1\">Instructions</button>\n    <button class=\"tabs__btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"vs-2\">Rubric</button>\n    <button class=\"tabs__btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"vs-3\">Submissions <span class=\"tabs__count\">28</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"vs-1\">Measure the mass of each potato slice before and after two hours in salt water.</div>\n  <div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"vs-2\" hidden>Method 30 %, results 40 %, discussion 30 %. Late work loses 5 % a day.</div>\n  <div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"vs-3\" hidden>28 of 32 students have submitted. 4 are still drafting.</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A card that changes its range",
        "desc": "The segmented control switches the period; the figure and its label swap below while the card frame stays put.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 360px;\">\n  <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Period\" data-lds-segmented onclick=\"const b = event.target.closest('.seg__btn'); if (!b) return; const i = [...this.querySelectorAll('.seg__btn')].indexOf(b); this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('[data-pane]').forEach((p, j) => { p.hidden = j !== i; });\">\n    <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Week</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Month</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Term</button>\n  </div>\n  <div data-pane style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter); margin-top: 16px;\"><p class=\"chart-card__big\">6 h 40 m</p><p class=\"card__sub\">Study time this week</p></div>\n  <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter); margin-top: 16px;\"><p class=\"chart-card__big\">27 h</p><p class=\"card__sub\">Study time this month</p></div>\n  <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter); margin-top: 16px;\"><p class=\"chart-card__big\">94 h</p><p class=\"card__sub\">Study time this term</p></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Formulir bertahap, maju dan mundur",
        "desc": "Lanjutkan dan Kembali mengganti isi langkah; header steps mengisi bilahnya dengan kurva in-out dan fokus pindah ke judul baru. Tidak ada yang bergeser ke samping, jadi mundur terasa sama dengan maju.",
        "html": "<div data-flow style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <ol class=\"steps\" aria-label=\"Permohonan izin usaha\"><li class=\"step is-current\"><span class=\"step__head\"><span class=\"step__dot\">1</span><span class=\"step__bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"step__label\">Jenis usaha</span></li><li class=\"step\"><span class=\"step__head\"><span class=\"step__dot\">2</span><span class=\"step__bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"step__label\">Dokumen</span></li><li class=\"step\"><span class=\"step__head\"><span class=\"step__dot\">3</span></span><span class=\"step__label\">Tinjau</span></li></ol>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; min-height: 132px;\">\n    <div data-pane style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\"><h3 class=\"card__title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Pilih jenis usaha</h3><p class=\"card__sub\">Usaha mikro, kuliner, dengan tempat usaha di rumah sendiri.</p></div>\n    <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\"><h3 class=\"card__title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Unggah dokumen Anda</h3><p class=\"card__sub\">KTP, kartu keluarga, dan foto tempat usaha.</p></div>\n    <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\"><h3 class=\"card__title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Tinjau dan kirim</h3><p class=\"card__sub\">Periksa jenis usaha dan ketiga dokumen, lalu kirim permohonan.</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"form__actions\" style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary\" data-back disabled onclick=\"const f = this.closest('[data-flow]'); const panes = f.querySelectorAll('[data-pane]'); let i = [...panes].findIndex((p) => !p.hidden); i = Math.max(0, Math.min(panes.length - 1, i + (-1))); panes.forEach((p, j) => { p.hidden = j !== i; }); f.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach((s, j) => { s.classList.toggle('is-done', j < i); s.classList.toggle('is-current', j === i); s.querySelector('.step__dot').innerHTML = j < i ? '<span class=&quot;ic&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;>check</span>' : String(j + 1); }); f.querySelector('[data-back]').disabled = i === 0; f.querySelector('[data-next]').textContent = i === panes.length - 1 ? 'Kirim permohonan' : 'Lanjutkan'; panes[i].querySelector('h3').focus();\">Kembali</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary\" data-next onclick=\"const f = this.closest('[data-flow]'); const panes = f.querySelectorAll('[data-pane]'); let i = [...panes].findIndex((p) => !p.hidden); i = Math.max(0, Math.min(panes.length - 1, i + (1))); panes.forEach((p, j) => { p.hidden = j !== i; }); f.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach((s, j) => { s.classList.toggle('is-done', j < i); s.classList.toggle('is-current', j === i); s.querySelector('.step__dot').innerHTML = j < i ? '<span class=&quot;ic&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;>check</span>' : String(j + 1); }); f.querySelector('[data-back]').disabled = i === 0; f.querySelector('[data-next]').textContent = i === panes.length - 1 ? 'Kirim permohonan' : 'Lanjutkan'; panes[i].querySelector('h3').focus();\">Lanjutkan</button></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<ol class=\"steps\" aria-label=\"Permohonan izin usaha\">…</ol>\n<section class=\"step-view\" aria-labelledby=\"step-title\" style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter);\">\n  <h3 id=\"step-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Unggah dokumen Anda</h3>\n  …\n</section>\n<!-- Render langkah baru (atau tampilkan): animasinya diputar setiap kali elemen ditampilkan.\n     Lalu pindahkan fokus ke judulnya. -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "Panel tab",
        "desc": "Garisnya bergeser; panel di bawahnya berganti dengan blur-in. `.tab-panel` sudah memiliki pergantian ini.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 460px;\">\n  <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Laporan jalan rusak\" data-lds-tabs>\n    <span class=\"tabs__ink\"></span>\n    <button class=\"tabs__btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"vs-1\">Rincian</button>\n    <button class=\"tabs__btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"vs-2\">Penanganan</button>\n    <button class=\"tabs__btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"vs-3\">Tanggapan <span class=\"tabs__count\">28</span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"vs-1\">Lubang selebar 1,5 meter di lajur kiri, dekat halte bus kota.</div>\n  <div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"vs-2\" hidden>Survei lokasi selesai. Penambalan dijadwalkan Selasa, perkiraan biaya Rp 4.500.000.</div>\n  <div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"vs-3\" hidden>28 warga mendukung laporan ini. 4 menambahkan foto baru.</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Kartu yang mengganti rentangnya",
        "desc": "Segmented control mengganti periode; angka dan labelnya berganti di bawah sementara bingkai kartu tetap di tempat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 360px;\">\n  <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Periode\" data-lds-segmented onclick=\"const b = event.target.closest('.seg__btn'); if (!b) return; const i = [...this.querySelectorAll('.seg__btn')].indexOf(b); this.parentElement.querySelectorAll('[data-pane]').forEach((p, j) => { p.hidden = j !== i; });\">\n    <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Minggu</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Bulan</button>\n    <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Tahun</button>\n  </div>\n  <div data-pane style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter); margin-top: 16px;\"><p class=\"chart-card__big\">12.480</p><p class=\"card__sub\">Penumpang bus kota minggu ini</p></div>\n  <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter); margin-top: 16px;\"><p class=\"chart-card__big\">51.326</p><p class=\"card__sub\">Penumpang bus kota bulan ini</p></div>\n  <div data-pane hidden style=\"animation: lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter); margin-top: 16px;\"><p class=\"chart-card__big\">604.912</p><p class=\"card__sub\">Penumpang bus kota tahun ini</p></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { Steps } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\n<Steps label=\"Application\" items={['Program', 'Documents', 'Review']} current={step} />\n<section key={step} style={{ animation: 'lds-blur-in var(--d-standard) var(--ease-enter)' }}>{views[step]}</section>",
